 n in 4 meals\, plus 50-80 g carbs before heavy lifting and carbs again af
 ter.\nCategory: gym\nRun volume: 0 km\n\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 7-8 min bike\, spl
 it squat isometric holds\, ankle rocks\, and hinge ramp sets.\n\n\nMain W
 ork:\n- Bulgarian split squat or front-foot elevated split squat: 4 x 8-1
 0 per leg at RPE 7-8.\n- Romanian deadlift: 3 x 8 at RPE 7-8 paired with 
 leg press or hack squat 3 x 10-15 at RPE 8.\n- Walking lunges with dumbbe
 lls: 2-3 x 12 steps per leg at RPE 7 paired with reverse Nordic curls 2 x
  6-10 at RPE 7 and leg extension 2 x 15-20 at RPE 8.\n- Core finisher: ca
 lf raises plus Copenhagen plank 2-3 sets each at RPE 7.\n- Activation: we
 ighted hyperextensions: 2 x 10-15 at RPE 5-6 using no more than 50% of no
 rmal working load\; stop if symptoms rise or the next morning is worse.\n
 \n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place c
 arbohydrates before and after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window st
 ays 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.\n\n\nProgression & G
 uardrails:\n- Progression: double progression\; add load only when tempo 
 and knee control stay stable at RPE 8 or lower.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
